  "html": "<section id=\"cw-layout-magazine\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: rgb(237, 244, 244); background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(30, 109, 128, 0.145) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 18px 18px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(33, 70, 83); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 0px 26px 26px; width: 100%; word-break: break-word;\"><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #214653; margin: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; width: 100%\"><section style=\"border: 1px dashed rgb(30, 109, 128); border-radius: 0px 42px 0px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 28px 18px; width: 100%;\"><p style=\"background: transparent; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(33, 70, 83); display: block; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0px 0px 24px; max-width: 100%; padding: 0px; text-align: left; width: auto;\">开场第一段：比赛结束后，人们先看到了比分。阅读一篇文章，也需要先交代背景，让读者知道事情从哪里开始。</p></section><p style=\"color: #214653; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\">开场第二段：比分接近，真正需要讨论的是关键时刻的判断。连续的正文应留在同一个阅读容器里，左右都应有清楚的留白。</p><p style=\"color: #214653; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\">开场第三段：接下来再进入具体章节。段落数量改变时，不应丢失内容，不应贴边，也不应为每段重复一层巨大的卡片内边距。</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 24px 0; text-align: left\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"></p><section style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; border-top: 1px dashed #52727c; box-sizing: border-box; display: block; margin: 28px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 18px 0; width: 100%\"><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 0 16px 0 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"><h2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; color: #1e6d80; display: block; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0 0 12px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\">从标题开始，建立阅读节奏</h2></section><section style=\"border-left: 1px dashed #1e6d80; box-sizing: border-box; display: block; margin: 20px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding: 0 0 0 16px; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; width: 100%\"><p style=\"color: #214653; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\">标题需要一个清楚的重心。<strong style=\"font-weight: 700\">重点句只强调一次</strong>，其余正文让段落长度、行距和留白承担节奏。</p><blockquote style=\"background-color: #d8e7e9; border: 1px solid #1e6d80; color: #214653; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 24px 0; padding: 20px; text-align: left\"><p style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\">排版的任务，是把内容的关系呈现出来。</p></blockquote><p style=\"color: #214653; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px; margin-bottom: 0\">每种风格都应该有自己的声音，同时让正文保持完整、清楚和可读。</p></section></section><section style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; border-top: 1px dashed #52727c; box-sizing: border-box; display: block; margin: 28px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 18px 0; width: 100%\"><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 0 16px 0 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"><h2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; color: #1e6d80; display: block; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0 0 12px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\">三个可以马上检查的地方</h2></section><section style=\"border-left: 1px dashed #1e6d80; box-sizing: border-box; display: block; margin: 20px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding: 0 0 0 16px; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; width: 100%\"><ul style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 22px\"><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\">标题是否有独立的视觉重心</li><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\">章节之间是否留出呼吸空间</li><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\">重点是否与普通正文形成清楚层级</li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 24px 0; text-align: left\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 24px 0; text-align: left\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"></p><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 20px 0 20px; table-layout: fixed; width: 100%\"><thead><tr><th style=\"background-color: #1e6d80; border: 1px solid #52727c; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">检查项</th><th style=\"background-color: #1e6d80; border: 1px solid #52727c; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">观察方式</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #52727c; padding: 9px 8px; verti